		(uuid "2103f85a-f60f-c19a-8890-95bdc60a8ff6")
	)
	(text_box "THE 50R TERM, THE JUMPER SHIPS REMOVED.\nFit only if the source drives 50 ohm.  A ZED-F9T is DESTROYED\nby fitting it: its TIMEPULSE pin is 5 mA absolute maximum and\n3.3 V into 50R asks for 66 mA.\nConversely, leaving it out on an 8 Vpp open-circuit source\nfloats the gate input to about +7.4 V, over the 74LVC1GU04's\n6.5 V absolute maximum.  On this channel it should be FITTED."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.2400 148.5900 0)
		(size 95.2500 21.5900)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 220 220 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4000 1.4000)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "56af39e7-53a6-ec3c-d3f8-7f65de07da36")
	)
	(text_box "THE BAV99 CLAMP IS DNP.\nFit only on a channel you will run UNTERMINATED with a source above about 6 Vpp\nopen circuit.  It is not fitted by default because its reverse leakage flows in\nthe 1M self-bias resistor: 10 nA is 10 mV of bias shift, leakage roughly doubles\nevery 10 degC, and at ~820 mV/ns that would swamp the whole long-tau drift\nbudget."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.2400 204.4700 0)
		(size 121.9200 17.7800)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 245 210 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4000 1.4000)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1bf4c681-259d-3abc-3e69-211d8ade73f3")
	)
	(text_box "THE SAMPLING FLIP-FLOP (FF1) IS DELIBERATELY ALLOWED TO GO METASTABLE - that is\nmeasurement.  Never put a synchronizer in front of it.\nTHE RETIMER (FF2) re-clocks on the next helper edge, so what leaves the board is\nalways a clean transition aligned to a helper edge.  It costs exactly one helper\ncycle of latency and destroys no phase information.\nThe 74LVC1G80 output is ~Q, so two stages restore the sense."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.7800 204.4700 0)
		(size 121.9200 17.7800)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 220 235 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4000 1.4000)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "227a70b4-8106-f19e-4340-53e57e63db11")
	)
